WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.570
Hello, and welcome to SetuHashi!

2
00:00:03.610 --> 00:00:05.139
We're so glad you're here.

3
00:00:05.470 --> 00:00:09.490
Our name joins two words
for bridge, setu in Sanskrit

4
00:00:09.530 --> 00:00:11.440
and hashi in Japanese.

5
00:00:11.650 --> 00:00:15.530
That is what we set out to be
for Japanese and Indian businesses.

6
00:00:15.810 --> 00:00:17.860
SetuHashi began with three people

7
00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:20.488
and two countries that
matter deeply to them.

8
00:00:20.770 --> 00:00:23.470
Raju, Shyam and Mak came
by different paths,

9
00:00:23.510 --> 00:00:25.220
but they shared a conviction:

10
00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:28.610
Japanese and Indian businesses
have strengths that fit,

11
00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:31.524
and a promising connection
is only the beginning.

12
00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:34.380
So we help turn connections
into business:

13
00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:38.580
finding worthwhile opportunities,
developing workable plans, helping

14
00:00:38.620 --> 00:00:42.240
put them into action, and
strengthening what already exists,

15
00:00:42.280 --> 00:00:44.290
in both countries and beyond.

16
00:00:44.430 --> 00:00:47.910
We work with Japanese and Indian
businesses, partners building

17
00:00:47.950 --> 00:00:50.280
together for other markets,
the providers

18
00:00:50.320 --> 00:00:52.210
and institutions that support them,

19
00:00:52.250 --> 00:00:55.480
and government bodies connecting
their regions with business.

20
00:00:55.520 --> 00:00:59.210
Our approach is to understand
each opportunity from both sides,

21
00:00:59.250 --> 00:01:02.040
and to keep its development
connected to delivery,

22
00:01:02.080 --> 00:01:05.010
bringing in the market knowledge,
operating capability

23
00:01:05.050 --> 00:01:07.850
or qualified specialists
the work requires.

24
00:01:07.910 --> 00:01:10.990
Everything we offer starts
with what you want to achieve:

25
00:01:11.030 --> 00:01:15.280
perhaps finding the right partner,
reaching customers in Japan or India,

26
00:01:15.350 --> 00:01:18.120
or turning interest into
a workable agreement.

27
00:01:18.160 --> 00:01:19.980
Each objective leads to services

28
00:01:20.020 --> 00:01:23.420
and specific offerings you can
explore, and discuss with us.

29
00:01:23.460 --> 00:01:25.190
You don't need a finished brief.

30
00:01:25.230 --> 00:01:27.170
We work with you
to understand the need

31
00:01:27.210 --> 00:01:29.290
and shape an assignment that fits.

32
00:01:29.330 --> 00:01:30.620
We agree the scope,

33
00:01:30.660 --> 00:01:35.280
our role and fees before work begins,
and make relevant interests clear.

34
00:01:35.410 --> 00:01:38.710
We can remain involved as
the agreed assignment requires.

35
00:01:38.820 --> 00:01:42.430
We are starting with three areas:
global capability centres,

36
00:01:42.470 --> 00:01:45.670
water solutions, and recycling
and waste management.

37
00:01:45.730 --> 00:01:49.170
As we learn, build relationships
and discover opportunities,

38
00:01:49.210 --> 00:01:50.660
our focus will evolve.

39
00:01:50.820 --> 00:01:54.360
Our experience pages bring these
ideas to life through case studies

40
00:01:54.400 --> 00:01:57.500
from our people's individual
careers and advisory work,

41
00:01:57.540 --> 00:02:00.810
alongside illustrative scenarios
showing how we could help.

42
00:02:00.850 --> 00:02:02.560
Each is clearly labelled.

43
00:02:02.720 --> 00:02:05.340
At the heart of SetuHashi
are its people.

44
00:02:05.480 --> 00:02:09.490
Raju Lalwani, born and raised in
Japan with Indian roots, understands

45
00:02:09.530 --> 00:02:12.690
Japanese customers and what
it takes to earn their trust.

46
00:02:12.730 --> 00:02:15.550
Shyam Sundar Pani brings
entrepreneurial energy

47
00:02:15.590 --> 00:02:17.000
and relationships across

48
00:02:17.040 --> 00:02:21.310
India's business ecosystems, helping
the right partners find one another.

49
00:02:21.380 --> 00:02:25.600
Makarand Datar, known as Mak, brings
more than thirty years of growth

50
00:02:25.640 --> 00:02:27.440
and transformation experience,

51
00:02:27.520 --> 00:02:30.600
alongside a perspective
shaped by travel across

52
00:02:30.640 --> 00:02:32.310
more than eighty countries.

53
00:02:32.450 --> 00:02:35.180
Together, they
are our Managing Partners.

54
00:02:35.270 --> 00:02:37.810
And Isha Lagu,
our Analyst for Business

55
00:02:37.850 --> 00:02:39.240
and Legal, is studying

56
00:02:39.280 --> 00:02:43.200
law and helps the team turn research
into clear recommendations.

57
00:02:43.360 --> 00:02:47.530
Whether you have an opportunity,
a challenge or simply an early idea,

58
00:02:47.690 --> 00:02:51.180
we would love to hear from you,
in English or Japanese.

59
00:02:51.300 --> 00:02:54.340
Write to us
at contact at setuhashi dot com.

60
00:02:54.540 --> 00:02:56.658
We look forward to the conversation.

